ion\n- Exploits Black's compromised king safety\n\n**Reason:** Capturing on d5 wins material (a central pawn) while Black's king is misplaced on f7 and cannot effectively counterattack. This gives me both a material and positional advantage, as Black will struggle to coordinate pieces with an exposed king in the center.\n\n**Answer:** P: e4-d5"}
